---
source: tests/render_golden.rs
description: hog --color never --timezone utc
input_file: tests/corpus/levels.jsonl
---
[TRC] trace level
[DBG] debug level
[INF] info level
[WRN] warn level
[WRN] warning shares the three-letter tag
[ERR] error level
[FTL] fatal level
[PNC] panic level
[INF] upper case still matches
[WRN] mixed case still matches
[WEIRD] an unknown level keeps its own text
[30] pino and bunyan send numbers
[NOTICE] a syslog level hog does not know
[ERR] the third candidate wins when it is the only one
